From: nuubOS Project <noreply@nuubos.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] nuubOS: idempotent SetFullscreen action

labwc 0.20.2 only has ToggleFullscreen. A window rule that uses it on
first map would turn fullscreen OFF for a client (an SDL2 port) that
already requested fullscreen at window creation. Ports need a stable,
idempotent way to enter fullscreen so wlroots can scan out their surface
directly; Quick Menu remains a layer surface above it.

Upstream-Status: Pending [matches upstream labwc SetFullscreen action]

--- a/src/action.c
+++ b/src/action.c
@@ -93,6 +93,7 @@
 	X(MAXIMIZE, "Maximize") \
 	X(UNMAXIMIZE, "UnMaximize") \
 	X(TOGGLE_FULLSCREEN, "ToggleFullscreen") \
+	X(SET_FULLSCREEN, "SetFullscreen") \
 	X(SET_DECORATIONS, "SetDecorations") \
 	X(TOGGLE_DECORATIONS, "ToggleDecorations") \
 	X(TOGGLE_ALWAYS_ON_TOP, "ToggleAlwaysOnTop") \
@@ -1202,6 +1203,11 @@
 			view_toggle_fullscreen(view);
 		}
 		break;
+	case ACTION_TYPE_SET_FULLSCREEN:
+		if (view) {
+			view_set_fullscreen(view, true);
+		}
+		break;
 	case ACTION_TYPE_SET_DECORATIONS:
 		if (view) {
 			enum lab_ssd_mode mode = action_get_int(action,
